          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "1. 5125                         STUDHAM\t\t\t    COMMON ROAD Studhamhall Farmhouse TL 01 NW 42/293 II 2. C16 or possibly earlier, externally much modernised.  Long range of 2 storeys and attics with old clay tile roof and modern casements.  Ground floor brick and jettied, first floor brick infilled timber frame.  Possible hall with external stack at left hand rear.  Interior largely timber-framed with many moulded beams, complex roof structure, and panelled rooms. Listing NGR: TL0126515325"
    }
